# FORGE agent data home (Cursor)

This project uses FORGE with **isolated memory persistence** for Cursor:

- Default data root: `~/.cursor/forge` (not `~/.claude`)
- Env var: `FORGE_AGENT_DATA_HOME` (set automatically by FORGE's Cursor `sessionStart` hook when hooks are wired)
- Project override: `.cursor/forge-agent-data.json` → `agentDataHome`

If the user asks where FORGE stored session context or learned skills, point them at `$FORGE_AGENT_DATA_HOME/session-data/` and `$FORGE_AGENT_DATA_HOME/skills/learned/`.

To **share** memory with Claude Code intentionally (not recommended for parallel use), set `FORGE_AGENT_DATA_HOME` to `~/.claude` in the shell or in `.cursor/forge-agent-data.json`.
